units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p s
atom_style atomic
region box block 0 66.06 0 66.06 0 213.18 units box
create_box 1 box
mass 1 92.90638
lattice bcc 3.303 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
region projectile0 block 0 66.06 0 66.06 0 66.059999 units box
region target0 block 0 66.06 0 66.06 66.059999 198.179999 units box
create_atoms 1 region projectile0
group projectile region projectile0
create_atoms 1 region target0
group target region target0
pair_style eam/fs
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp pe ke etotal press pxx pyy pzz vol
thermo_modify flush yes
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian units box
fix equilibration all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 100000
velocity projectile set NULL NULL 20 sum yes units box
fix production all nve
run 100000
